  title: THE OUTBREAK
  description: My Pontiff, troubling news. Reports speak of a sickness brewing within
    the Warrens. Fortunately, it was detected early, and the city authorities are
    moving with unusual efficiency, after all, this is no trifling matter. The affliction
    is not apocalyptic in nature, but it has already claimed several lives. What
    instructions should we give to the clerics stationed in the district?
